{"seq":2,"slug":"first-in-human-studies","title":"博士转化医学 — 首次人体试验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside/first-in-human-studies","wordCount":1860,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士转化医学-首次人体试验\">博士转化医学 — 首次人体试验</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>首次人体试验（First-in-Human, FIH）是候选疗法从临床前跨入临床的关键里程碑。FIH 试验的主要目标是建立人体中的安全性、耐受性和药代动力学特征，为后续剂量选择提供基础。在肿瘤学领域，FIH 试验还承担早期疗效信号探索的任务。这一阶段的设计决策——起始剂量、递增策略、安全性监测——直接关系到受试者安全和药物开发效率。</p>\n<p>FIH 试验的关键设计要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>起始剂量选择</strong>：基于动物毒理学数据推算人体最大推荐起始剂量（MRSD）</li>\n<li><strong>剂量递增策略</strong>：从保守的 3+3 法则到模型指导的贝叶斯方法</li>\n<li><strong>安全性监测</strong>：剂量限制性毒性（DLT）的定义和评价窗口</li>\n<li><strong>药代动力学采样</strong>：确认人体暴露量与临床前预测的一致性</li>\n<li><strong>伦理考量</strong>：知情同意的特殊挑战、弱势群体保护</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[临床前毒理学数据] --&gt; B[MRSD 计算]&#10;    B --&gt; C[FIH 起始剂量]&#10;    C --&gt; D{剂量递增}&#10;    D --&gt;|3+3 法则| E[固定规则递增]&#10;    D --&gt;|CRM/BOIN| F[模型指导递增]&#10;    D --&gt;|加速滴定| G[单患者加速 → 标准递增]&#10;    E --&gt; H[MTD/RP2D 确定]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[扩展队列&lt;br/&gt;初步疗效]\">graph TD\n    A[临床前毒理学数据] --&gt; B[MRSD 计算]\n    B --&gt; C[FIH 起始剂量]\n    C --&gt; D{剂量递增}\n    D --&gt;|3+3 法则| E[固定规则递增]\n    D --&gt;|CRM/BOIN| F[模型指导递增]\n    D --&gt;|加速滴定| G[单患者加速 → 标准递增]\n    E --&gt; H[MTD/RP2D 确定]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[扩展队列&lt;br/&gt;初步疗效]</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"起始剂量推算-从动物到人\">起始剂量推算：从动物到人</h3><p>FDA 指南（2005）推荐的标准起始剂量推算流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>确定 NOAEL</strong>：在最敏感动物种属中确定无可观察不良效应水平（No Observed Adverse Effect Level）</li>\n<li><strong>转换为 HED</strong>：使用体表面积转换系数将 NOAEL 转换为人体等效剂量（Human Equivalent Dose）</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>NOAEL</mtext><mtext>animal</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>animal</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>human</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HED = \\text{NOAEL}_{\\text{animal}} \\times \\frac{K_m(\\text{animal})}{K_m(\\text{human})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NOAEL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">animal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">human</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">animal</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 值：小鼠 3，大鼠 6，犬 20，猴 12，人 37。</p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><strong>应用安全系数</strong>：MRSD = HED / 安全系数（通常 10 倍，高风险药物可增至 20-100 倍）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>替代方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MABEL（Minimum Anticipated Biological Effect Level）</strong>：对于高风险生物制品（如免疫调节剂），基于药理学活性而非毒性计算起始剂量。2006 年 TGN1412 事件后 EMA 强制要求</li>\n<li><strong>PAD（Pharmacologically Active Dose）</strong>：基于临床前药效学数据的起始剂量选择</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>基于</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>保守程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NOAEL/HED</td>\n<td>毒理学</td>\n<td>小分子化合物</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MABEL</td>\n<td>药理学活性</td>\n<td>免疫治疗、细胞治疗</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PAD</td>\n<td>药效学</td>\n<td>靶向治疗</td>\n<td>中-低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PK-guided</td>\n<td>暴露量</td>\n<td>PK 数据充分时</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"剂量递增策略对比\">剂量递增策略对比</h3><p><strong>3+3 法则</strong>是最传统的递增策略：每个剂量水平入组 3 例，若 0/3 发生 DLT 则递增，1/3 DLT 则扩组至 6 例，≥2/6 DLT 则宣布前一水平为 MTD。其优点是简单透明，缺点是样本效率低且 MTD 估计偏差大——模拟研究表明 3+3 法则在真实 MTD 处的推荐概率仅为 30-50%。</p>\n<p><strong>贝叶斯模型指导方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CRM（Continual Reassessment Method）</strong>：维护剂量-毒性模型的后验分布，每队列后选择使预估 DLT 率最接近目标的剂量。准确性显著优于 3+3</li>\n<li><strong>BOIN（Bayesian Optimal Interval Design）</strong>：预先计算决策表（escalate/stay/de-escalate），无需实时模型更新，兼顾统计优越性和操作简易性</li>\n<li><strong>mTPI-2（Modified Toxicity Probability Interval）</strong>：类似 BOIN 的区间设计，但基于不同的优化准则</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BOIN 决策规则: </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>递增</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>维持</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>递减</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BOIN 决策规则: } \\begin{cases} \\text{递增} &amp; \\text{if } \\hat{p}_j \\leq \\lambda_e \\\\ \\text{维持} &amp; \\text{if } \\lambda_e &lt; \\hat{p}_j &lt; \\lambda_d \\\\ \\text{递减} &amp; \\text{if } \\hat{p}_j \\geq \\lambda_d \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BOIN </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">决策规则</span><span class=\"mord\">: </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">递增</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">维持</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">递减</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 个剂量水平的观察 DLT 率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是预计算的递增和递减阈值。</p>\n<p><strong>加速滴定设计（Accelerated Titration）</strong>：在低剂量水平采用单患者队列快速递增（如修改的 Fibonacci），一旦出现 ≥Grade 2 毒性或相关 PK 变化，切换至标准 3+3 或模型指导递增。适用于预期治疗窗较宽的药物。</p>\n<h3 id=\"扩展队列与-seamless-phase-i-ii\">扩展队列与 Seamless Phase I/II</h3><p>传统的 MTD 确定后，FIH 试验通常设置扩展队列（Expansion Cohort）以收集初步疗效信号。现代 FIH 设计日益采用 Seamless Phase I/II 框架，将剂量递增和疗效评估整合在一个方案中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>双终点设计</strong>：同时监测毒性（DLT）和疗效（如客观缓解率），推荐最优生物学剂量（OBD）而非 MTD</li>\n<li><strong>回填设计（Backfill）</strong>：在完成安全性评估的较低剂量水平回填患者以收集额外疗效数据</li>\n<li><strong>多臂剂量优化</strong>：在确认安全性后，以多个候选剂量并行入组评估疗效</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"安全性监测框架\">安全性监测框架</h3><p>DLT 的定义因治疗领域而异。肿瘤领域典型的 DLT 定义基于 CTCAE（Common Terminology Criteria for Adverse Events）分级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>≥ Grade 4 血液学毒性持续 &gt;7 天</li>\n<li>≥ Grade 3 非血液学毒性（特定例外除外）</li>\n<li>任何 Grade 5 事件（死亡）</li>\n<li>因毒性导致的剂量中断 &gt;2 周</li>\n</ul>\n<p>DLT 评价窗口通常为治疗第一周期（如 28 天），但对于延迟毒性的药物（如免疫检查点抑制剂），评价窗口可能需要延长至 2-3 个周期。</p>\n<p>数据安全监查委员会（DSMB/DMC）在 FIH 试验中的角色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实时审查所有 DLT 事件</li>\n<li>评估递增决策是否遵循方案规定</li>\n<li>在非预期毒性模式出现时建议暂停或修改方案</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一种新型双特异性抗体（CD3×HER2）的临床前数据显示：食蟹猴 NOAEL = 3 mg/kg（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 12），但在 0.1 mg/kg 时已观察到细胞因子释放。请分别用 NOAEL/HED 方法和 MABEL 方法计算 MRSD，并论证哪种方法更适合此类药物。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个使用 BOIN 方法的 FIH 剂量递增方案：目标 DLT 率 25%，5 个剂量水平，队列大小 3。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（提示：可使用 BOIN R 包 <code>get.boundary()</code> 函数），并与 3+3 法则在相同场景下的模拟操作特性进行比较。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某 CAR-T 细胞治疗的 FIH 试验需要考虑与传统小分子完全不同的安全性监测。列出 CAR-T FIH 试验中 DLT 定义的特殊考虑（CRS 分级、神经毒性、B 细胞再生时间），以及为什么标准的 DLT 评价窗口（28 天）可能不足。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论 FIH 试验中的伦理挑战：(a) 健康志愿者 vs. 患者入组的适用条件，(b) 治疗性错误认知（therapeutic misconception），(c) 在低剂量队列中患者获益概率极低的伦理合理性。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>FDA Guidance</strong>：Estimating the Maximum Safe Starting Dose in Initial Clinical Trials for Therapeutics in Adult Healthy Volunteers (2005) — MRSD 计算的标准指南</li>\n<li><strong>EMA Guideline</strong>：Strategies to Identify and Mitigate Risks for First-in-Human and Early Clinical Trials (2017) — TGN1412 后的安全性指南</li>\n<li><strong>Le Tourneau et al. (2009)</strong>：<em>Dose escalation methods in phase I cancer clinical trials</em>（JNCI）— 剂量递增方法的经典综述</li>\n<li><strong>Liu &amp; Yuan (2015)</strong>：<em>Bayesian optimal interval designs for phase I clinical trials</em>（JRSS-C）— BOIN 方法的原始论文</li>\n<li><strong>BOIN R 包</strong>（CRAN）：提供完整的 BOIN 设计计算和模拟工具</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>首次人体试验是转化医学链条中风险最高、信息密度最大的阶段。起始剂量推算需要在 NOAEL 驱动和 MABEL 驱动方法之间根据药物风险类别做出选择。剂量递增策略已从经验性的 3+3 法则进化为统计性能更优的贝叶斯模型指导方法（CRM、BOIN），后者在 MTD 估计准确性和患者分配上均显著优于传统方法。扩展队列和 Seamless Phase I/II 设计的兴起正在模糊 I 期和 II 期试验的传统边界，使 FIH 试验承担更多疗效探索功能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士转化医学 — 首次人体试验","id":"博士转化医学-首次人体试验"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"起始剂量推算：从动物到人","id":"起始剂量推算-从动物到人"},{"level":3,"text":"剂量递增策略对比","id":"剂量递增策略对比"},{"level":3,"text":"扩展队列与 Seamless Phase I/II","id":"扩展队列与-seamless-phase-i-ii"},{"level":3,"text":"安全性监测框架","id":"安全性监测框架"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士转化医学 — 临床前模型验证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside/preclinical-model-validation"},"next":{"title":"博士转化医学 — 实施科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside/implementation-science"}}